    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Be the first player to play all your cards (empty your hand) to win the deal. Players take turns matching the current lead card or passing; the last player to match plays a new card until one player runs out.',
        "Cards represent Shogi pieces with specific movement rules. Focus on defensive (Uke) strategy. Captured cards can be redeployed (drop mechanic from Shogi). Promotion possible when reaching opponent's territory.",
        'Card-based Shogi mechanics',
        'Drop captured pieces',
      ],
